// The workspace of the two Go modules of this repository: the library
// hop.top/pact-go (./go) and the commands hop.top/pact (./cli). It
// resolves hop.top/pact-go for the command module from this tree. Consumers of
// either module never read this file, and neither mirror carries it.
go 1.26.1

use (
	./go
	./cli
)

// cli/go.mod requires hop.top/pact-go at the placeholder version below until
// the library is released. Loading the module graph reads the go.mod of
// every requirement, and that version exists nowhere, so the workspace
// points it at the library here. Once a pact-go tag exists, cli/go.mod
// requires that version and this replace is deleted (RELEASING.md).
replace hop.top/pact-go v0.0.0-00010101000000-000000000000 => ./go
